---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: "Meaningful Psychiatry - Dr. Badeea Qureshi - Washington State"
description: "Psychiatrist in Washington State, blending professional expertise with a personal touch. Specializing in mental health care across diverse cultures."
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Telehealth psychiatry across Washington State</p>
      <h1>Online psychiatry for children, teens, and adults across Washington State.</h1>
      <ul class="hero__facts">
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-child-reaching" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ages 8+</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i> WA residents</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-pills" aria-hidden="true"></i> Medication management &amp; psychotherapy</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i> Private-pay &amp; select insurance</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="{{ booking.general }}" class="btn btn--lg">Book an Appointment</a>
        <a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}" class="btn btn--lg btn--ghost"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i> Call or Text {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
      <a href="/insurance/" class="text-link text-link--light">Check insurance and fees <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__people">
      <figure class="person-card person-card--a">
        <img src="/images/2024/09/Badeea_Qureshi_MD.webp" alt="Dr. Badeea Qureshi MD">
        <figcaption><strong>Dr. Badeea Qureshi, MD</strong><span>Psychiatrist</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="person-card person-card--b">
        <img src="/images/2026/10/Francis_Agbotse2.webp" alt="Francis Agbotse, PMHNP">
        <figcaption><strong>Francis Agbotse, PMHNP</strong><span>Psychiatric Nurse Practitioner</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="insurance-band">
  <div class="container insurance-band__inner">
    <p class="insurance-band__label">Now accepting</p>
    <ul class="chips">
      <li>Aetna</li><li>Ambetter</li><li>Medicare</li><li>Medicaid</li><li>Private pay</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/insurance/" class="text-link">Insurance &amp; payment details <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trust-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="trust-bar__list">
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong>Licensed in Washington</strong>Telehealth for WA residents</span></li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong>Secure &amp; confidential</strong>HIPAA-compliant video visits</span></li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong>Verified profile</strong><a href="{{ site.profiles.psychologyToday }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Psychology Today</a></span></li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-newspaper" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong>As featured in</strong>NBC News &amp; Refinery29</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p>
      <h2>Care that looks at the whole person</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--3">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Evidence Based Medicine</h3>
        <p>We aim to use evidence-based medicine to guide us in collaborating with you when arriving at a suitable medication regimen for your psychiatric needs. In certain cases, medications may not be indicated, and we can discuss the clinical decision making process and other supports.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Tailored Treatment Regimens</h3>
        <p>We address your mental health needs from multiple angles, including medication management, individual psychotherapy, drawing on social supports and resources, and recommendations for somatic therapies and alternative medicine modalities if applicable.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Secure Telehealth</h3>
        <p>Appointments take place over a secure, HIPAA-compliant video platform. Attend from a private location without commuting, sitting in a waiting room, or rearranging your entire day around an office visit.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet your providers</p>
      <h2>Experienced, compassionate psychiatric care</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="provider-grid">
      <article class="provider">
        <img src="/images/2025/12/DR_Badeea_Qureshi.webp" alt="Dr. Badeea Qureshi MD" class="provider__img">
        <div class="provider__body">
          <h3>Dr. Badeea Qureshi, MD</h3>
          <p class="provider__role">Psychiatrist · Private pay</p>
          <p class="provider__creds"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> WA license {{ site.credentials.qureshiLicense | replace("Washington ", "") }} · <a href="{{ site.profiles.psychologyToday }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verified on Psychology Today</a></p>
          <p>Trained at the University of Liverpool School of Medicine and the University of Washington Psychiatry Residency Program, Dr. Qureshi weaves together mind, body, and spirit, with a focus on time-limited, personalized medication regimens and psychotherapy.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            {% set p = booking.qureshi %}{% set btnClass = "btn" %}{% include "partials/book-button.njk" %}
            <a href="/about-us/#badeea" class="btn btn--outline">Read Bio</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="provider">
        <img src="/images/2026/09/Francis_Agbotse.webp" alt="Francis Agbotse, PMHNP" class="provider__img">
        <div class="provider__body">
          <h3>Francis Agbotse, PMHNP</h3>
          <p class="provider__role">Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner · Aetna, Ambetter, Medicare &amp; Medicaid</p>
          <p class="provider__creds"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> WA license {{ site.credentials.agbotseLicense | replace("Washington ", "") }}</p>
          <p>Trained at Windsor School of Medicine in Saint Kitts and the University of Alabama at Birmingham, with over a decade of experience in psychiatry, Francis is well equipped to work with complex psychiatric presentations, multiple diagnoses, and complicated medication regimens, in a collaborative, patient-centered way.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            {% set p = booking.francis %}{% set btnClass = "btn" %}{% include "partials/book-button.njk" %}
            <a href="/about-us/#francis" class="btn btn--outline">Read Bio</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p>
      <h2>Three simple steps to your first visit</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step__num">1</span>
        <h3>Reach out</h3>
        <p>Book online through Osmind, or call or text {{ site.phone }}. We respond within one business day.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step__num">2</span>
        <h3>Complete onboarding</h3>
        <p>Our admin will help you schedule your first intake appointment after you complete your onboarding paperwork in the secure Osmind patient app.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step__num">3</span>
        <h3>Meet your provider</h3>
        <p>Your first appointment is a 60-minute comprehensive evaluation of your mental health history, current concerns, and treatment goals.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="center"><a href="{{ booking.general }}" class="btn btn--lg">Book an Appointment</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our services</p>
      <h2>Medication management and psychotherapy</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
      <article class="card card--service">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-prescription-bottle-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Medication Management</h3>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Personalized psychiatric medication regimen</li>
          <li>Evidence based medicine</li>
          <li>Continuous assessment of medication needs</li>
          <li>Monitoring for side effects, drug interactions and efficacy</li>
          <li>Goals for time limited medication use where appropriate</li>
          <li>Minimizing risks of polypharmacy and considerations around deprescribing</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--service">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-comments" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Psychotherapy</h3>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Judgement free and confidential</li>
          <li>Goal directed</li>
          <li>Psychoanalytic and supportive approach</li>
          <li>Nurturing environment</li>
          <li>Direct communication style</li>
          <li>Focus on personal and interpersonal growth</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--navy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Integrative approach</p>
      <h2>Specialty Medication Management Services</h2>
      <p class="section-head__sub">We treat a wide range of conditions for patients age 8 and up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="condition-grid">
      {%- for s in specialties %}
      <div class="condition">
        <i class="{{ s.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mission">
  <div class="container mission__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Meaningful Psychiatry</p>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Our mission at Meaningful Psychiatry is to broaden the definition of mental health care by embracing the full spectrum of the human experience. We believe in zooming out, exploring beyond the surface, and understanding the intricate connections between the mind, body, and spirit.</p>
      <p>Rooted in a deep understanding of cultural diversity and personal growth, we strive to create a compassionate and inclusive environment where every patient feels seen, heard, and valued.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="mission__pillars">
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-spa" aria-hidden="true"></i> Holistic Healing</li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas" aria-hidden="true"></i> Global Awareness</li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-comments" aria-hidden="true"></i> Purposeful Conversations</li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></i> Full Picture of Health</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Integrative approach</p>
      <h2>Special Interests in Psychotherapy</h2>
      <p class="section-head__sub">Dr. Qureshi embraces a compassionate and integrative approach to mental health, recognizing the spiritual and psychological dimensions of challenges related to finances, sexual health, and personal relationships.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="interest-grid">
      {%- for s in interests %}
      <a class="interest-card" href="/service/{{ s.slug }}/">
        <span class="interest-card__icon"><img src="{{ s.icon }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
        <span class="interest-card__more">Learn more <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/testimonials.njk" %}

<section class="section section--light featured-section">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/featured-box.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">From the blog</p>
        <h2>Latest articles</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/blog/" class="text-link">View all articles <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="post-grid">
      {%- for post in collections.posts | head(3) %}{% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/contact-section.njk" %}
